// Formidable Extended Actions: the node types of every form action this module ships, in ONE file.
// Each namespace is declared here, once: the engine merges every .cnd of the module into one definition, and a prefix
// spelled twice leaves the module installed and never started. The families below keep the node type and property
// names they had as separate modules.

